{"id":"35e6f6a939e2c058","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-inner-dodd-sound-extender.md","title":"ZFC Inner Dodd Sound Extender","display":"df-zfc-inner-dodd-sound-extender — ZFC Inner Dodd Sound Extender","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner-dodd-sound-extender","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner-dodd-sound-extender"],"display":"df-zfc-inner-dodd-sound-extender — ZFC Inner Dodd Sound Extender","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-total-extender-dodd-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner-dodd-sound-extender"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner-dodd-sound-extender</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner-dodd-sound-extender — ZFC Inner Dodd Sound Extender"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b89be05e707ab52\" href=\"?note=2b89be05e707ab52\" title=\"58-df-total-extender-dodd-data.md\">58-df-total-extender-dodd-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,t,\\tau\\in V\">\\(E,t,\\tau\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=\\langle t_0,\\ldots,t_{m-1}\\rangle\">\\(t=\\langle t_0,\\ldots,t_{m-1}\\rangle\\)</span> is a finite sequence and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is an ordinal.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\\)</span> is the class ultrapower of the universe by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DoddParameter}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{DoddParameter}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DoddProjectum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{DoddProjectum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\\)</span> 及支撑限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\upharpoonright X\">\\(E\\upharpoonright X\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-total-extender-dodd-data</code> 中实际的商与生成元构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDoddSoundExtender}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDoddSoundExtender}_S\\)</span> is retained as a metasyntactic three-place predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}dodd\\text{-}sound\\text{-}extender}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDoddSoundExtender}_S(E,t,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E)\n\\land\\mathrm{DoddParameter}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(t,E)\n\\land\\mathrm{DoddProjectum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\tau,E,t)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;\\Bigl(\nE\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}\n(t(i)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}i))\n\\in\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\nE\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}(\\alpha\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(t))\n\\in\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}dodd\\text{-}sound\\text{-}extender}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDoddSoundExtender}_S(E,t,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E)\n\\land\\mathrm{DoddParameter}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(t,E)\n\\land\\mathrm{DoddProjectum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\tau,E,t)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;\\Bigl(\nE\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}\n(t(i)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}i))\n\\in\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\nE\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}(\\alpha\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(t))\n\\in\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Dodd parameter and projectum are explicit arguments certified by their canonical fine-structural relations; a unary predicate cannot safely refer to free symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_E\">\\(t_E\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_E\">\\(\\tau_E\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A class ultrapower of the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is now explicitly metatheoretic. The set-model ultrapower dependency is not misapplied to it.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-total-extender-dodd-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b89be05e707ab52","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-total-extender-dodd-data.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,t,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"t=\\langle t_0,\\ldots,t_{m-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DoddParameter}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DoddProjectum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\upharpoonright X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDoddSoundExtender}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}dodd\\text{-}sound\\text{-}extender}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDoddSoundExtender}_S(E,t,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Extender}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E)\n\\land\\mathrm{DoddParameter}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(t,E)\n\\land\\mathrm{DoddProjectum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\tau,E,t)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;\\Bigl(\nE\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}\n(t(i)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}i))\n\\in\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\nE\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}(\\alpha\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(t))\n\\in\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(V,E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"t_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_E","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":2033,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-356","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner-dodd-sound-extender]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2334","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner-dodd-sound-extender.md|58-df-zfc-inner-dodd-sound-extender]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2b89be05e707ab52"]}